  "business": {
    "title": "Alphabet以广告现金流为底盘，AI与云决定下一阶段重估空间",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "text": "Alphabet不是单一广告公司，而是围绕Google Services、Google Cloud和Other Bets组织的业务集合；其中Google是最大部分。Google Services的核心产品/平台包括Search、YouTube、Android、Chrome、Gmail、Maps、Play、Gemini等，收入主要来自Google广告以及订阅、平台和设备；这意味着公司现金生成的主引擎仍是面向消费者和广告主的流量与分发，而不是硬件本身。",
        "kind": "fact",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-028173790917c679",
            "block_id": "block-000059-ab2556c8",
            "quote": ""
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-028173790917c679",
            "block_id": "block-000077-0ba57163",
            "quote": ""
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-028173790917c679",
            "block_id": "block-000080-7bd7f443",
            "quote": ""
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-028173790917c679",
            "block_id": "block-000088-0c7f9036",
            "quote": ""
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-028173790917c679",
            "block_id": "block-000092-b1521a49",
            "quote": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "从披露看，Alphabet正在把AI从“功能”推向“分发和变现方式”的重构变量：公司在Search中推出AI Overviews和AI Mode，并在Google Cloud上提供企业AI解决方案。管理层同时提示，新产品/服务可能首先以用户体验为中心，随后才变现，因此短期内AI更像是需要持续投入、并可能改变广告和云的单次变现结构，而不只是简单的增收工具。",
        "kind": "inference",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-028173790917c679",
            "block_id": "block-000391-132d42ca",
